Subject: [PATCH] Meeting notes under each agenda item; Skills needed in every
 Recruiting Update box; drop the Outlook note and the Open Roles note and
 geography filter

Mark, Oct 5 2026:
- Meeting Agenda: a notes box under every item (auto-grows, saves to the shared
  store after a pause or on blur, kept in place across re-renders). The Monday
  archive (/api/agenda/archive) now carries notes with each archived item.
- 8 Week Outlook: the "every project a consultant is booked to that week ..."
  note is gone (tools/unmerge_open_roles.py).
- Open Roles & Recruiting: no note line and no location filter
  (tools/flatten_open_roles.py); each role's yellow box shows the Recruiting
  Update and a "Skills needed" line derived from the role, requisition and
  project titles (tools/build_outlook_section.py). Roles with no requisition
  say so in the same box.
- tools/ now also holds agenda_section.py, build_outlook_section.py and
  dashboard_style.css from the pipeline so the layout passes can be rebuilt
  from the repo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
